==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Teacher A.'s long range may look intimidating at first, its damage output is not that high so simply use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to reliably deal damage to it.

